OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm 91 but I've defied my age    
OL,4,Awith another hole-in-one'              
OL,6,FMaeve McVeigh is the oldest playing    
OL,7,Fmember at her golf club - but for her, 
OL,8,Fage is just a number.                  
OL,10,F"I'm 91-and-a-bit but I feel like I'm  
OL,11,Fbarely 50 - and golf makes me feel     
OL,12,Fyoung," she says.                      
OL,14,FThis month, when playing in the ladies'
OL,15,Fwinter league, the County Tyrone woman 
OL,16,Fachieved every golfer's dream of a     
OL,17,Fhole-in-one.                           
OL,19,F"I just hit the ball as I would        
OL,20,Fnormally that day, I knew it was a good
OL,21,Fshot because I had reached the green - 
OL,22,Fbut I didn't know how good.            
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
